If we define an input buffer of 16th bytes and use the 16th byte to simulate garbage appearance upon decryption, we can easily trigger the tag generation failure. The proposal in https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32h7xx-hal-driver/issues/88#issue-3162577502 fixes that UB.

